text = "[u]Controls[/u]
AD to move pieces
W to rotate
S to move down
Space to Quick Drop

[u]Game Mechanics[/u]
The more lines you clear the more damage you'll deal to the enemy. The enemy will place attacks on the board, if you place a piece there you'll trigger its effect. Your pieces have effects that do different things."

